  "id": "RAW_295be983e3",
  "title": "腾讯混元发布 Hy4，首次成为最强开源模型之一",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5ODYwMjI2MA==&mid=2649808030&idx=1&sn=b1a1332f38f89c2d4cc91899900ddf33",
  "date": "2026-11-04 13:30:00",
  "author": "腾讯技术工程",
  "siteName": "腾讯技术工程",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p><span>腾讯技术工程</span> <span>2026-11-04 13:30</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">广东</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261104122256_d19b769.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.325\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"640\" style=\"width:100%;\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"188\" data-imgfileid=\"502301126\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260717122720_e2d7034.gif\"></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">刚刚，腾讯混元发布最新一代大语言模型 Hy4。随着模型能力的再次全面跃升，Hy 首次跻身最强开源模型之列。Hy4 将于近期开源模型权重，发布模型系统卡片，并积极推进更负责任的开源，重点关注网络和生物安全等风险。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">相比于 Hy4 preview，<span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Hy4&nbsp;</span>在预训练和后训练上显著扩展了数据和训练规模，首次引入视觉理解能力，并大幅提升了指令遵循、长文理解、长程智能体等综合效果。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"Hy4 评测榜单对比\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.7355555555555555\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" style=\"max-width:100%;display:block;margin:16px auto;border-radius:4px;width:100%;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"425\" data-imgfileid=\"502324350\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261104122256_913e2a0.png\"></p>\n  <p nodeleaf=\"\"></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">通过视觉理解、推理和工具调用能力，Hy4可以完成细粒度图像处理、复杂图表分析和数学视觉推理等任务。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">Hy4 也首次支持电脑操作（Computer Use），可以结合命令行和图形界面，处理工作和生活中的各类任务。针对 Blender、CAD 等专业软件和跨应用长程任务，混元了开展专项训练，大幅提升了专业任务的规划与执行能力。</span></p>\n  <p nodeleaf=\"\"></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.05em;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">通过随拍照片，确定地理位置并核实信息</span></span></p>\n  <h2 style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-size: 17px;font-weight: 700;color: rgb(0, 82, 255);margin: 28px 0px 14px;padding-left: 12px;border-left: 6px solid rgb(0, 82, 255);line-height: 1.4em;\"><span leaf=\"\">模型和产品深度 Co-Design，持续解锁真实生产力场景</span></h2>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">得益于模型基础能力的全面提升，以及模型与产品的深度Co-Design，Hy4 解锁了更多</span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\">真实生产力</span><span leaf=\"\">场景。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\">在办公场景，Hy4 全面提升了 WorkBuddy 的用户体验。评测结果显示，Hy4 平均效果得分 83.18 分，任务通过率 96.15%，12 个场景中 9 个排名国内第一。实际体验中，Hy4 在视觉创意、3D 场景构建和网页开发等任务上兼顾效果与效率。同时，针对WorkBuddy的人机双写特色功能，Hy4 在文档美观度、稳定性和可用性上均有明显提升。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">伴随 Hy4 上下文学习能力的持续提升，模型能更好地理解多源复杂信息，成为用户的长期个人助理。借助 WorkBuddy 的企业微信套件，Hy4 可以连通聊天记录、邮件、文档、日程与会议等日常工作信息。多个项目并行推进时，Hy4 能理清各项目的推进历史与最新进展，识别待跟进的任务、需要准备的会议和临近截止的事项，及时提醒用户并协助安排优先级。此外，由 Hy4 支撑的团队协作功能将随新版“项目”在 Workbuddy 上线。</span></p>\n  <p nodeleaf=\"\"></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">出差后的发票整理和财务发票稽查</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">Hy4 重点强化了专业金融分析能力。基于真实金融场景构建了数千个工作空间和上万个高质量任务，让模型充分学习基金研究、证券分析、量化策略、资产配置、公司金融、财税会计等方向的专业流程与规范。混元联合腾讯金融科技 FiT 开展了 213 位专家的金融众测，其中 153 位来自外部的头部金融机构，且七成拥有五年以上工作经验。基于 579 个真实金融任务的结果显示，Hy4 综合表现位居开源模型第一（众测得分：Hy4 3.04、Kimi K3.1 Pro 2.68、GLM-5.3 2.68、DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017 2.97）。此外，在金融智能体公司讯兔科技的内部评测 IRAB 中，Hy4 较 Hy4 preview 提升 12.03 个百分点。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">为了提升金融等各类办公场景的实用性，混元还启动了针对时效检索、多源信息整合与事实一致性校验的专项搜索优化。在自建测试中，Hy4 的幻觉率从 preview 版的 12.95% 降至 7.2%，猜测导致的错误率从 23.1% 降至 5.6%。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">在前端与游戏开发场景，混元针对前端的复杂交互、业务逻辑、状态管理、前后端联动等进行了专项优化，让模型生成的界面不仅好看，而且功能完整可用。混元与腾讯 IEG 专业游戏开发者合作，持续优化数据和评测质量，重点提升了游戏功能实现、玩法逻辑、状态理解和资产处理等能力，实现了对 UE、Unity、Godot 等主流引擎的深度适配，并开始扩展至多人联机游戏开发。相比 Hy4 preview，Hy4 在 GameDev 和 GameLogic 评测中分别提升 19.1% 和 9.8%。</span></p>\n  <p nodeleaf=\"\"></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.05em;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">复古QQ游戏街机厅</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">在科学研究领域</span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\">，Hy4&nbsp;</span><span leaf=\"\">将复杂推理、科学编程与长程任务执行相结合，进一步提升端到端推进科研工作的能力。在涵盖 7 大学科、123 项可执行研究任务的 TenureTrail 内部评测中，Hy4 在数学构造、物理建模、地球环境、系统工程和社会经济决策等领域展现出扎实的科研能力。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">Hy4 正积极为下一阶段的递归自我改进（RSI）做准备，提升各种模型研发任务的能力。结合 Hyra2.0，Hy4 优化了内部同架构小模型的预训练基础设施，并自动训练出在多项评测中优于官方的 Jev 模型。同时，混元也开源了由 Hy4 协同 Hyra2.0 研发的单细胞表征基础模型 HyCell 和物理场基础模型 HyPDE，希望将模型辅助科研的成果转化为社区可复用的工具。</span></p>\n  <h2 style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-size: 17px;font-weight: 700;color: rgb(0, 82, 255);margin: 28px 0px 14px;padding-left: 12px;border-left: 6px solid rgb(0, 82, 255);line-height: 1.4em;\"><span leaf=\"\">关注网络和生物安全，持续推进负责任的开源</span></h2>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">针对模型在网络和生物等方面潜在的安全风险，混元以更负责任的方式进行训练、开源与发布。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">网络安全方面，Hy4 在训练中仅纳入与 PoC 生成、漏洞修复相关的防守性网络安全数据，同时剔除漏洞利用、逆向、渗透等攻击性训练内容，力求避免潜在进攻性能力的提升。混元组织来自腾讯玄武和科恩实验室的安全专家，围绕密码分析、逆向工程、漏洞利用等方向进行了审计，结果表明：Hy4 在加密算法的逆向求解、对抗二进制混淆、漏洞利用等进攻性能力上未展现出突出风险。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">生物安全方面，Hy4 的开放式实验设计能力与前沿模型存在明显差距（Hy-BioExperime</span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\">ntBench: 30.4/100）。混元组织了内部专家对轨迹进行审计，发现模型基础生物知识的掌握能</span><span leaf=\"\">力较强，但将知识转化为可执行实验方案的能力仍然有限，尚未发现其能够显著降低实施生物化学危害行为的门槛。</span></p>\n  <p nodeleaf=\"\"></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.05em;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Hy4 单机1.5小时完成 700 万细胞小鼠胚胎三维重建</span></span></p>\n  <h2 style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-size: 17px;font-weight: 700;color: rgb(0, 82, 255);margin: 28px 0px 14px;padding-left: 12px;border-left: 6px solid rgb(0, 82, 255);line-height: 1.4em;\"><span leaf=\"\">持续追求极致性价比，Hy4 flash 近期上线</span></h2>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">目前，Hy4 已经在腾讯云Tokenhub、WorkBuddy/CodeBuddy、元宝、企业微信智能助理大圆、ima 等产品上线，API 同步接入 OpenRouter、 Hermes、OpenCode 等平台。QQ、王者荣耀、和平精英、微信读书、腾讯新闻等腾讯系产品也在持续接入中。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯混元以“模型实用性”为核心原则，在不断追求智能上限的同时，为用户提供高性价比服务。Hy4 在模型性能大幅超越 Hy4 preview 的同时，定价不变：输入 6元/百万 tokens，输出 18 元/百万 tokens，缓存命中 0.3 元 / 百万 tokens。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">Hy4 flash 也将于近期发布。Hy4 flash 在继承 Hy4 能力的基础上，大幅减低任务成本，为用户提供极致性价比的模型。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">为收集更多用户反馈、持续提升模型能力，WorkBuddy/CodeBuddy 将在 11月 4 日至 11月 15日期间，为用户提供一定额度的免费使用。此外，即日起至 2026 年 12 月 31 日，Hy4 在腾讯云 TokenHub 按刊例价 5 折计费。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">自今年 2 月重建基础设施以来，腾讯混元大模型平均每两个月推出一个大版本，先以 Preview 形式开放，再根据用户反馈优化模型发布正式版。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">同时，混元在参数规模和数据规模上持续爬坡，Hy3 系列参数不到 300B，Hy4 系列达到 770B。据悉，下一代 Hy5 规模将进一步扩大。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, PingFangSC, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.75em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">混元团队表示，尽管 Hy4 已经是目前最强的开源模型之一，但与顶尖闭源模型仍然存在较大差距。混元将持续稳健地扩展预训练和后训练规模，努力缩小和顶尖闭源模型的差距。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5609375\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"640\" style=\"width:100%;\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"324\" data-imgfileid=\"502301122\" src=\"https://image.jido.dev/20260703140059_8e88fb2.gif\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.3234375\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"width:100%;\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"187\" data-imgfileid=\"502301121\" src=\"https://image.jido.dev/20260703140059_dfde2b3.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"3\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "腾讯混元发布 Hy4 大语言模型，首次成为最强开源模型之一，引入视觉理解能力、电脑操作功能，并在多个场景中实现显著性能提升。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "腾讯混元发布 Hy4 大语言模型，首次成为最强开源模型之一，引入视觉理解能力、电脑操作功能，并在多个场景中实现显著性能提升。",
  "summary": "腾讯混元于 2026 年 11 月正式发布最新一代大语言模型 Hy4，标志其首次跻身最强开源模型之列。Hy4 在预训练和后训练上显著扩展数据和训练规模，首次引入视觉理解能力，大幅提升指令遵循、长文理解和长程智能体等综合效果。模型支持电脑操作（Computer Use），可结合命令行和图形界面处理工作任务，针对 Blender、CAD 等专业软件进行专项训练。Hy4 在办公场景中提升了 WorkBuddy 用户体验，金融分析、前端游戏开发和科学研究等领域均取得显著成绩。为提升安全性，混元在训练中仅纳入防守性网络安全数据，组织安全专家进行审计。同时，Hy4 flash 将于近期发布，提供更高性价比的服务。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "Hy4 引入视觉理解能力，实现细粒度图像处理和复杂图表分析",
      "explanation": "通过视觉理解、推理和工具调用能力，Hy4 能完成数学视觉推理等任务，显著提升模型的综合处理能力。"
    },
    {
      "point": "支持电脑操作（Computer Use），提升专业任务的规划与执行能力",
      "explanation": "针对 Blender、CAD 等专业软件进行专项训练，结合命令行和图形界面，处理工作和生活中的各类任务，实现对主流引擎的深度适配。"
    },
    {
      "point": "在多个场景中实现显著性能提升",
      "explanation": "在办公场景中，WorkBuddy 用户体验得分 83.18 分，任务通过率 96.15%；金融领域综合表现位居开源模型第一；前端游戏开发场景 GameDev 和 GameLogic 评测中分别提升 19.1% 和 9.8%。"
    },
    {
      "point": "以更负责任的方式进行训练、开源与发布",
